				1735,
				5
			],
			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Configure debug build artifacts for Electron profile testing\n\nRename the Mountain binary and package identifiers to include the full build configuration descriptor: DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_ElectronProfile_EsbuildCompiler_Mountain. This distinguishes the debug build targeting the Electron runtime environment from production builds.\n\nUpdate tauri.conf.json resources to explicitly map all Sky build targets (Browser, Electron, Bundled, BrowserProxy, Isolation, Favicon, Manifest.json, Mountain, Worker.js, and Static/* assets) for bundling. Reorganize the resource array to group related entries and remove redundant paths.\n\nAlso remove the now-unused WorkspaceFileService module declaration from Source/Workspace/mod.rs, keeping only the documentation summary for workspace lifecycle handling.\n\nThis configuration enables testing the MetroHastings integration against the Electron profile while preserving backup copies of the original Cargo.toml and tauri.conf.json.",
			"SHA": "c62faa2f412251a2fbfae0e170e8b81fe5123ab4"
		},
